%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ffd20afc55e26974198aa9b1c0c0eedf, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialLevel
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LevelSubtitleDialogueObject
  AudioClip:
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: ringng
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 795f427c74947774bac40e00da08df91, type: 3}
      volume: 0.858
      pitch: 1.566
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: (Ringing)
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 1
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 48068f3b47e1e6942a155acf05f879b7, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: Heya, This your boss, Welcome to The Space-Whip Delivery Service,
      the premium space delivery service that distributes goods to any systems in
      the milky way.
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 2
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cc41494c47ce6d44788a90712f3d78b9, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: You must be unforu- ahem, a new intern we have just hired yesterday.
      Welcome aboard, you may think that since you have the job, you will ease right
      in.
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 3
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7097e933cf3d93b40a50c9b50a37c993, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: " Wrong!!!! Anyone who thinks that is a moron. This job requires
      extreme focus, resilience and problem solving. If you got all those, then you
      will survive however most don\u2019t."
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 4
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 039efee7ec6dc7747bf79299c94d25bf, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: "so I\u2019ll give you a basic run down. You see those Three big
      buttons in front of you. Those Buttons are the controls you will be using to
      get the ship to the next planet that is waiting for our company's delivery.\r\n"
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 5
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ab83207ab06b8ff42b364ed1a5b68860, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: Arrow Buttons, send turning signals to the ship making it turn
      from left to right. The last Button will signal to the ship to stop or go based
      on your last input.
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 6
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f13c77cc5be1bfd46912b9de7bb6bfa3, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: "All the ships are run by our own openAI, that is why we have you
      to make sure it doesn\u2019t go off course from the desired destination."
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 7
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f58d0c0d05ab26540908cc1a32f712b7, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: "What Else\u2026 oh yes the interface, what you see on your screen
      is the view of the ship you will be directing. This comes from our galactic
      satellite above the milky way."
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 8
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e6e4095b2cabe4144b123e514dc8f90f, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: The bottom left is the amount the ship can withstand any damage,
      if it reaches 0% you will have no job.
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 9
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fc516af3158b1174ab18f6781fe02b9e, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: Top Left is the ship's temperature if it reaches 100 degrees once
      again no job. On the bottom right is the ship's fuel gauge if the ship's fuel
      is all gone, again no job.
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 10
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7c189a52d42ec23438d177fd0121540b, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: The top right is an arrow that will tell you where the ship needs
      to go, under it is the distance the planet is relative to the ship. so the
      less the number is the closer you are to your destination.
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 11
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4599c8fd18a57c544b6a43f5270e9afb, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: One more thing, we have a momentum tracker to check if any debris
      or asteroid is coming the ship's way, so if it pops up try and dodge it so
      the ship does not get damaged. Be quick and hasty.
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 12
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 733a59708b5a6de46886abe549af67b6, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: Well that should be all for now, this delivery you are doing today
      is a simple delivery in one of our popular systems where our headquarters is
      located. Not too far, pretty simple for your type skill set.
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 13
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f4498e7f2dc9793428befab96e27a36c, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: Good luck if you damage anything or lose anything you know what
      happens.
